# Cursor & AI Agent Rules for LQD Score Exporter
# Full specification is maintained in GEMINI.md

Please follow all 10 Golden Rules defined in GEMINI.md:
1. SBD 12026218 MUST be permanently purged from all tables, sheets, calculations, ranks, and exports.
2. Grade rankings (Hang Khoi) for Grade 10, 11, and 12 must be computed independently. Never combine all 3 grades into one ranking pool.
3. Use Standard Competition Ranking (1, 2, 2, 4) for total score and combinations.
4. Calculate 6 admission combinations (A00, A01, B00, C00, D01, D07) with both Class Rank and Grade Rank. Missing subjects = null/empty, never replace with 0.
5. Column header matching must distinguish between 'Ngày sinh' and subject 'Sinh' (Biology). Do NOT use .includes('sinh') for birth dates.
6. Summary table TB_mon_lop must have separate benchmark rows for 'TOÀN KHỐI 12', 'TOÀN KHỐI 11', 'TOÀN KHỐI 10' instead of a single merged school row.
7. Excel workbooks must conform to the 37-column standard format, frozen header row, AutoFilter on student rows, and yellow TBM LOP summary rows.
8. Web UI Hall of Fame must support 3 scopes (School, Grade 10/11/12, Class) with podium top 3 and cards top 4-10.
9. Firestore calls must not add custom headers (to avoid CORS preflight failures). Bulk grade fetch should be prioritized.
10. Ensure run_termux.sh and auto_crawl.yml are synchronized with changes.
